{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17543","headline":"礼部权侍郎阁老史馆张秘监阁老有离合酬赠之什宿直吟翫聊继此章 · 崔邠","name":"礼部权侍郎阁老史馆张秘监阁老有离合酬赠之什宿直吟翫聊继此章","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"脉脉羡佳期，月夜吟丽词。\n谏垣则随步，东观方承顾。\n林雪消艳阳，简册漏华光。\n坐更芝兰室，千载各芬芳。\n节苦文俱盛，即时人竝命。\n翩翻紫霄中，羽翮相辉映。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔邠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17543.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17543","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}